            // All other fields (clients, slots, requests, responses) remain the same.
            // Therefore, any invariant that holds for these fields in the pre state
            // continues to hold in the post state.

            // We need to prove that all invariants hold in the post state.
            // Since only combiner changed, we need to check each invariant:

            // 1. clients_complete: unchanged (clients doesn't change)
            // 2. slots_complete: unchanged (slots doesn't change)
            // 3. clients_size: need to verify for Responding case
            // 4. not_waiting_inv: unchanged (clients and slots don't change)
            // 5. waiting_inv: unchanged (clients and slots don't change, requests/responses don't change)
            // 6. request_stored_inv: unchanged (requests doesn't change)
            // 7. response_stored_inv: unchanged (responses doesn't change)
            // 8. combiner_has_inv: depends on combiner, need to verify

